 "literal": "Pleasure he-desires-not, work he-who-desires, his relatives' sorrow having-wiped-away supporting pillar.",
 "translation": "He who desires not personal pleasure but desires to accomplish his work is a pillar that wipes away the sorrows of his kin and supports them.",
